cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this repository."
type: software

title: "Prototype Expressiveness"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code accompanying the paper "Less-Than-One-Shot Learning in
  High-Dimensional Spaces": an affine upper-envelope illustration of
  two-prototype soft-label expressiveness, and a dimension sweep showing that
  while the constructed decision regions exist at every tested dimension, their
  uniform measure collapses as the ambient dimension grows.
